{"parse": {"title": "RUG-14", "pageid": 23041, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/RUG-13\" title=\"RUG-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RUG-14</span><a href=\"/wiki/RUG-15\" title=\"RUG-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RUG</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">14</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B7.91.E8.80.85.E5.8F.B2.E8.AF.97\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"跑者史诗\">跑者史诗</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 跑者史诗</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Epic of Runners</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>簇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>温<span class=\"color-value\"></span>暖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>火<span class=\"color-value\"></span>源<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>缀<span class=\"color-value\"></span>满<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>蜜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>般<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>泪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>半<span class=\"color-value\"></span>属<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>半<span class=\"color-value\"></span>属<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>朋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>友<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>朋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>友<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>挂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>念<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1510114</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>观众们已经入席就坐，并没有人因为踩踏或推搡受伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-307411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>今晚到来的人类参赛选手已经登记完毕，相对应的人类独有与神秘学家混合运动项目也已草拟完毕——预计三日后开始进入比赛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-307514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-307514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-307514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>哈啊——我不行了，我真的一根指头也动不了了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是几近于奇迹的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人都奔走着，奔走着，奔走着——像是蟒蛇吞食大象那样消化着过剩的工作。直到如今，一切都完成得如此恰好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>来吧，小火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>是我们出场的时候了——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>哈……哈哈，我们又一次一起走在这样璀璨的道路上了！和平乌鲁！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>跑吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>孩子，跑吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-307611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>如同你曾许诺的一样——点亮那只乌卢鲁的火把！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>如同……我曾许诺的一样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>心脏砰砰直跳，肋骨根部颤颤，如同一只鸟儿寄宿在胸膛中，正想振翅而去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点的脚步是轻快的，与她愉快的心一样，与她疲惫的身体不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我在奔跑，而千百年前的奔跑于我而言正如昨日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我跑过漫长的跑道，我脚踩着炙热的红土，我正在流汗，如同一枚闪闪发亮的星星！我将要前往赛场的最高处，点亮那只火把——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>和平乌鲁！和平乌鲁！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我如你愿望一般长大了吗？我是一个新的我了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>欢呼、歌唱、口哨与快门淋满年轻姑娘的背脊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她尽可能快速地跑着，打开嗓子呼唤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>这对我来说的一瞬间，对你来说，却是数以千万计的漫长日夜，我想让你满意，我想让你快乐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我的朋友！我的朋友啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>你已经是我的小火了，但你也不只是我的小火……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>你还是我的可燃点，我的小姑娘……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>你已经长大了，如我无数次梦到的那样成长了——这儿的毒蛇没有伤你分毫，没有损害你的身体与心灵——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_kerandianbenpao3\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_kerandianbenpao3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao3.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao3.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao3.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_kerandianbenpao3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众：</div><div>哎呀？那是什么？圣火中流出了好多水滴——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-307612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>呜哇哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-307310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-307310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-307310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>和，和平乌鲁……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火焰在泪水中熄灭，小祭司的脚步猛地停止，左右颠倒着失去了重心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇摇不定地向前扑倒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众：</div><div>火……圣火、圣火它——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众：</div><div>是——是那个拉普拉斯的孩子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众：</div><div>火——圣火！圣火重新被点燃了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>重燃的火焰凝聚在年轻孩子们相连的手中，温热宜人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>爱兹拉惶惶然地四处张望起来，人群的喝彩这才到达他耳中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>成……成功了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>乌卢鲁运动会的开幕式，成功了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>太好了，太好了！我们成功了！谢谢你——爱兹拉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点呵护着尚且脆弱的和平乌鲁，一把抱住和自己一般纤细的少年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>你的手中着火，你……你也和我有一样的想法，对不对？如果不是真心渴望着乌卢鲁运动会，那些火焰是不会在你身上燃烧的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我……我的确很希望这个比赛举办成功。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>它对你们很重要，现在……对我们也是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>爱兹拉露出笑容，他离开怀抱，将自己与可燃点的手高高举起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>所有现场的、广播前的、电视与网络前的人类与神秘学家呀！我请你们与我一同见证这火炬的点燃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>她的名叫和平乌鲁，象征着和平、拼搏与竞技的崇高精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>在过去的数千年中，无数比赛之内这象征着和平与所有美好精神的火种，曾登至最高的山峰，行至幽深的海峡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>她高飞直到宇宙，与所有繁星展现，又于船中、飞行器中、双脚之下、双手之上传递。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>而此次，唯一一次，将被点燃的手炬奔火而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>人类的双手与神秘学家的双手在此一同燃烧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点&amp;爱兹拉：</div><div>在此处，我们许诺将忘却仇恨、纷争、纠乱与混杂的昨日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点&amp;爱兹拉：</div><div>我们将奔跑，以竞技的精神，我们将行走，以人最初的姿态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点&amp;爱兹拉：</div><div>我们彼此比量，参与大过于胜利。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RUG-14"}}